# Enterprise overlay (overlay/enterprise) in front of GRFICS's own DMZ: IT and a second, separate DMZ (jump host,
# historian mirror) behind ent-fw, which takes a leg on the plant DMZ (192.168.90.0/24) as its "OT" side. The plant
# router (GRFICS's own firewall, process LAN 192.168.95.0/24) stays where it is, between that DMZ and the PLC.
ENT_OT_FW=192.168.90.254
ENT_PLC=192.168.95.2
ENT_HMI=192.168.90.107:8080
# The HMI and the OPC server (opc01) are plant-DMZ hosts behind ent-fw; the DMZ historian subscribes to opc01.
ENT_OT_HOSTS="HMI chem-opc"
ENT_JUMP_ALLOW="192.168.90.107:8080"
ENT_HIST_ALLOW="192.168.90.40:4840"
ENT_HIST_SOURCE=192.168.90.40:4840
ENT_HIST_PROTO=opcua
ENT_HIST_OPCUA_PATH=/chem/
